{"pageid":1279,"title":"Banana","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Banana</span>","revid":21532,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Banana</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/62/BananaFruit.png/revision/latest?cb=20240417172951\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"BananaFruit\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/62/BananaFruit.png/revision/latest?cb=20240417172951\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/62/BananaFruit.png/revision/latest?cb=20240417172951 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/62/BananaFruit.png/revision/latest?cb=20240417172951 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"BananaFruit\" width=\"194\" height=\"285\" data-image-key=\"BananaFruit.png\" data-image-name=\"BananaFruit.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">To sell/Make into jam</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n<big><i>\"Bananas are elongated, yellow fruit with a soft, creamy texture.\"</i></big>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Banana</b> is a item that can be found on <a href=\"/wiki/King_Palm\" title=\"King Palm\"><b>King Palm</b></a> trees. Can spawn in bunches ranging from 15-30.\n</p><p>It may be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\"><b>Jer Junkman</b></a> for $50 per <b>Banana</b>. In its jam form it may be sold for $200.\n</p><p>Increases jump height to when eaten, to about the same height as with a <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a>. (Does not stack with the coils)\n</p><p>When put into a <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, the fill level increases by ~1.75% per banana.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\